# Copy to `.env` (or `.env.local`) only if you need to pin the backend address.
#
# Left unset, a development build derives the computer's LAN address from the
# Expo dev server, and the Android emulator uses http://10.0.2.2:4001. Set this
# when running a build with no dev server attached, or when the derived address
# is wrong (use your computer's current LAN IPv4 and the backend port).
#
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.1.2:4001
